*.pyc

# Firebase migration -- never commit service account keys or installed deps.
# functions/ and tools/ are NOT blanket-ignored here (unlike on main, which
# never tracks them at all) -- this branch tracks real source under both
# (functions/index.js, tools/firestore-mirror/mirror.js, etc.), so only
# their generated node_modules/ subtrees and the Firebase CLI's own local
# hosting cache are ignored.
node_modules/
*-service-account*.json
*-sa-key*.json
.firebase/
firebase-debug*.log
